cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: bridge-conformance
abstract: >-
  Fault-injection harness for services that turn payment and stablecoin callbacks into ledger entries.
  Duplicates, out-of-order events, lost responses with late retries, crashes between writes, stale replays and tampered or forged copies, checked against the true history, with shrunk counterexamples. Tested on synthetic data only.
authors:
